{"version":1,"content":"<p>日劇天王堺雅人主演的話題劇《VIVANT》第2季已於本月初大結局，但熱潮未減，電影版將接力12月4日在日本上映。</p><p>據電影公司透露，預售開始後反應熱烈，上映首3日累積票房已超過28億日圓(約1.3億港元)，將超越本月由電影《哥斯拉-0.0》創下</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:24:02.131330+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:03:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.840025+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.840025+00:00","content_hash":"9de20afa19adc6922b14b1a3909f5285f7f3f3faf8ee9391b1f21acd49d99372","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}